    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>Only portfolio Owners, Admins, and Managers can view and export billing details.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HWDTW0QB69EA31N531CXD33D\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how you can better understand billing across multiple accounts using a portfolio. </p>\n<p>You can monitor the total spend and usage for each linked account in a portfolio as well as get a detailed view each plan in the account. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HWDTW0QB31DS82Q97AMKK1NG\">View billing details</h2>\n<p>To see the billing details in a portfolio, navigate to <strong>Manage &gt;</strong> <strong>Billing</strong>. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\">Here, you’ll see a table view of each linked account and its corresponding billing details.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720904199323\" alt=\"Billing tab in a portfolio\" width=\"624\" height=\"276\"></p>\n<p>This view shows you the: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Total plan value</strong> \n<ul>\n<li>The total cost per month for all paid plans or “Contract” if the account is <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/18745921973915\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">manually billed</a>.</li>\n<li>The total does not include any taxes. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Plan usage </strong>\n<ul>\n<li>This indicates whether the account is:\n<ul>\n<li>Under the plan limit (0–74%), in blue.</li>\n<li>Near plan limit (75–99%), in yellow.</li>\n<li>Over plan limit (100% and more), in red. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>The account plan usage updates in real time each time you load the page. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Billing cycle</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The dates of each account’s current billing cycle.</li>\n<li>If manually billed: shows as either “N/A” or the contract start and end date. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>There’s no cost to having a portfolio, so the portfolio itself will not show in the <strong>Billing</strong> tab. </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion accordion--default\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item\">\n<div class=\"accordion__item-title\"><strong> What do I see if the account is a parent or child account?</strong></div>\n<div class=\"accordion__item-content\">\n<p>For anyone using <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/6199831051035\">shared billing</a>, what you see depends on if the parent account is linked to the portfolio. </p>\n<p>If the parent account is linked to the portfolio, the <strong>Billing </strong>tab initially only shows the parent account, but it includes the total usage and plan values for the entire account family. For a more detailed look, you can click the name of the parent account to see all of the children accounts.</p>\n<p>If you have a child account linked to a portfolio but not the parent account, you will not see any rows in the <strong>Billing </strong>tab for that account family. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HWDTW0QBDPPJEA9EN228DVYS\">See plan usage and payment details</h3>\n<p>You can also get a more detailed view of your plan usage and your billing payment method for each account. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the account name in the tableview. </li>\n<li>In the right sidebar, review your usage for each plan in the <strong>Plan usage details</strong> tab.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720904202139\" alt=\"Detailed view of usage for each plan in an account\" width=\"395\" height=\"457\">\n</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Billing details</strong> to view the billing type (e.g., contract, credit card, etc.)<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720898881307\" alt=\"Showing the payment method for the account\" width=\"430\" height=\"185\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01HWDTW0QB3KK5GG0HHGPXZ02F\">See usage and cost of each plan for an account</h3>\n<p>To view how much each plan in an account costs and your current usage:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the down arrow next to the account you want to look at. </li>\n<li>After the information for this account expands, review your monthly plan costs and your current usage for each plan. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>Note that anything marked by “n/a” means you do not have are not on this plan and are not paying for it. </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720898883867\" alt=\"Example of viewing the cost and usage per plan in an account\" width=\"624\" height=\"301\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HWDTW0QB65K2035QPA1RAB3S\">Export account billing information</h2>\n<p>If you’d like to export see your account values, plan usage, etc. in a CSV file:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Manage &gt; Billing</strong>. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Export CSV</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28720898885531\" alt=\"Top of the Billing tab in a portfolio, with the Export CSV button on the far right\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Your file will immediately be downloaded to your computer. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HWDTW0QB4FX1MTYNQMKC18RS\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Learn more about portfolios:\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/25185047957275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Understanding portfolio reporting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/25185154392603\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Understanding your portfolio settings</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Find out more about <a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/optimize-your-analytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">analyzing your performance in Klaviyo</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
